    "アプリを作る・直すときは、次の内容を Anthropic 社の AI(Claude)に送ります。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you build or edit an app, the following is sent to Anthropic's AI (Claude)."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "アプリを作る・直すときは、次の内容を Anthropic 社の AI(Claude)に送ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "アプリを作る・直すときは、話した内容・会話・アプリの設計を Anthropic 社の AI に送ります。同意を取り消すと、生成と対話が使えなくなります(閲覧・記録は使えます)。送信済みの内容は取り消せません。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you build or edit an app, what you said, the conversation and the app design are sent to Anthropic's AI. If you withdraw consent, generation and chat are disabled (viewing and recording still work). Data already sent cannot be recalled."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "アプリを作る・直すときは、話した内容・会話・アプリの設計を Anthropic 社の AI に送ります。同意を取り消すと、生成と対話が使えなくなります(閲覧・記録は使えます)。送信済みの内容は取り消せません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
